    kind: invariant  # 615d
    title: "requests/httpx/urllib3 have ZERO rows in the python I/O catalogue, so requests.post(url, secret) yields no net_send boundary; the header's 'detected transitively' rationale is false because the library source is not in the analyzed tree"  # 615d
    status: violated  # 615d
    priority: 1  # 615d
    parent:  # 615d
    tags:  # 615d
    - io_boundary  # 615d
